  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67eb6452bf5f2224083042268f30f622, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\u2328\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Which hotkeys does Lore support, and can I change them?
  _description: '**Ctrl+F / Cmd+F** Quick Search, **Alt+Left / Backspace** and **Alt+Right**
    back and forward, **arrow keys** move through the Contents (Left jumps back to
    them), **Insert** new Category, new Entry or duplicate, **F2** rename, **Delete**
    delete (asks first), **+** open the matching Library, **Page Up / Page Down /
    Home / End** scroll the page, **Escape** finish editing, clear the search or
    close a Library.


    The Lore hotkeys are fixed.'
  _sortOrder: 6
